---
description: >-
  Sub-day scheduling with tickInterval set to 15minute and an %H:%M
  axis format, tasks measured in hours, verifying fine-grained
  minute-level tick spacing.
---
gantt
  title A Gantt Diagram
  dateFormat   YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat   %H:%M
  tickInterval 15minute
  excludes     weekends

  section Section
  A task           : a1, 2022-10-03, 6h
  Another task     : after a1, 6h
  section Another
  Task in sec      : 2022-10-03, 3h
  another task     : 3h
